zig-recast is a translation to Zig of Recast, from recastnavigation 1.6.0
(https://github.com/recastnavigation/recastnavigation). It is an altered
version of the original software: the code is rewritten in Zig, with its own
interface. It is licensed under the same terms as the original, whose notice
follows unchanged:

Copyright (c) 2009 Mikko Mononen memon@inside.org

This software is provided 'as-is', without any express or implied
warranty.  In no event will the authors be held liable for any damages
arising from the use of this software.

