src/cosf.zig is a translation to Zig of cosf from Arm's optimized-routines
(https://github.com/ARM-software/optimized-routines), the code glibc's cosf
is built from. The files it translates carry the notices "Copyright (c)
2018-2024, Arm Limited." (math/cosf.c) and "Copyright (c) 2018-2026, Arm
Limited." (math/sincosf.h and math/sincosf_data.c). optimized-routines is
licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception; the translation is used
under the MIT licence, as optimized-routines gives it:

